        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(cron): purge orphaned cron_jobs rows on agent delete",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nWhen an agent is deleted via CLI, `cron_jobs` rows referencing the deleted agent (by `agent_id` ) are not cleaned up from the shared state SQLite database, leaving orphaned schedules.\r\n\r\n## Why This Change Was Made\r\n\r\nAdds `purgeAgentCronJobs()` as a best-effort cleanup function called from the CLI agent-deletion fallback path (`agents.commands.delete.ts`).\r\n\r\nThe Gateway path (`deleteAgentConfigEntry`) is intentionally NOT wired here — the cron service owns loaded job state, persistence, timers, and events. Direct SQLite row deletion would bypass that lifecycle. A future PR should add a cron-service-owned bulk removal API for the Gateway path.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\n### Before (main) — orphaned cron data confirmed\r\n```\r\n$ sqlite3 ~/.openclaw/state/openclaw.sqlite \\\r\n  \"SELECT job_id, name, agent_id, owner_agent_id FROM cron_jobs\r\n   WHERE agent_id = 'proof-main-test' OR owner_agent_id = 'proof-main-test';\"\r\nproof-cron-1|test-cron|proof-main-test|proof-main-test\r\n# Agent deleted via CLI, cron_jobs row remains\r\n```\r\n\r\n### After (fix) — purgeAgentCronJobs cleans up\r\n```\r\n$ sqlite3 ~/.openclaw/state/openclaw.sqlite \\\r\n  \"SELECT job_id, name, agent_id, owner_agent_id FROM cron_jobs\r\n   WHERE agent_id = 'proof-fix-test' OR owner_agent_id = 'proof-fix-test';\"\r\n# (empty — cron was purged during agent deletion)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Tests\r\n- `src/cron/store/purge-agent-cron-jobs.test.ts` — 3 tests\r\n- `src/commands/agents.delete.test.ts` — 12 tests (including new \"purges cron_jobs rows on agent delete\")\r\n\r\n## Files Changed\r\n\r\n| File | Change |\r\n|------|--------|\r\n| `src/cron/store/purge-agent-cron-jobs.ts` | New: Kysely `eb.or()` based cleanup |\r\n| `src/cron/store/purge-agent-cron-jobs.test.ts` | New: 3 unit tests |\r\n| `src/commands/agents.commands.delete.ts` | +3: import + call in CLI fallback |\r\n| `src/commands/agents.delete.test.ts` | +36: mock wiring + integration test |\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
